0..74 Comment "// A record pattern over a plain record binds a field the arm never reads:"
75..150 Comment "// the binder still answers at the field of its label, as a component of an"
151..227 Comment "// eager product does. Before the fix the unread binder answered nothing, so"
228..263 Comment "// the editor showed no type at it."
